      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹11.47 (vs ₹15.00 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹11.47 (down from ₹15.00 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹28.7b (down 14% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹4.20b (down 24% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 15% (down from 16% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by lower revenue. Revenue is forecast to grow 32% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 16% growth forecast for the Aerospace & Defense industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 11% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 29% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
